# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0014160> (TCR-alpha-beta-positive T-cell deficiency)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "DOID:0111977") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "OMIM:615387") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-4062-6158") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0014160> "A non-severe combined immunodeficiency disorder manifesting with recurrent respiratory infections, candidiasis, diarrhea, and failure to thrive. Patients show a clear predisposition to herpes viral infections, and features of immune dysregulation, including hypereosinophilia, vitiligo, and alopecia areata. Other features include lymphadenopathy and hepatosplenomegaly. CD3+ T-cells express TCR- gamma|delta, but little or no TCR-alpha|beta.")
