AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://clinicalgenome.org/affiliation/50031/") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0014572> "An autosomal recessive spinocerebellar ataxia caused by disease-causing variants in the SLC9A1 gene, characterized by early-onset cerebellar ataxia, cognitive or developmental delay, seizure, and cerebellar atrophy. Patients may also present with varying degrees of nystagmus, oculomotor apraxia, amelogenesis imperfecta and sensorineural hearing loss.")
